n is in `tests/gateway/test_telegram_group_gating.py:468`.\n- `gateway/authz_mixin.py:516` authorizes all members of a Telegram group listed in `TELEGRAM_GROUP_ALLOWED_CHATS`; the documented config is at `website/docs/user-guide/messaging/telegram.md:993`.\n- Telegram channel prompts were added in `0d05bd34f831c7c0e2635a5001344d413e039c50`.\n", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4972546424/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}]